// @name         קול – ivelt רעדן (Kol: Yiddish voice for ivelt)
// @namespace    https://kol-status-q7m4x2.sites.tab.bot/
// @version      1.1.0
// @description  Talk into an iVelt post box using the same on-device listening model from Kol.
